---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Mission | VNH" description="The mission behind VNH.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Our Mission</div>
      <h1 class="display">Freedom Through Action</h1>
      <p>Real people. Real purpose. A community built around useful ideas, personal responsibility, and practical solutions.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container page-copy">
    <p>VNH exists to bring together practical products, useful solutions, independent thinking, and a community that values freedom and responsibility.</p>
    <p>We are building this site as a place to discover new products, share ideas, and stay connected as VNH grows. The mission page will expand as the brand story and community programs are finalized.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/#keep-updated">Keep Updated →</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
